Z||000000||Gokart||03-17-2000||09:40 PM||||And here I was starting to daydream about how awesome this spring/summer were going to be for me and my GT. Was starting to drive her more often and thinking about all the projects ahead. Lots of rain had washed away the salted roads and some of them were even being swept. THEN WAM! Another blast from ol' man winter. Now the roads are full of salt/sand again. Had to take the japcrap to work and when I got home the wind had blown the cover off my GT and now it's got that white sh*t all over it. WHEN THE HELL IS SPRING GONNA START! Calendar says the 21st, but who knows. The winter blues are here again.||||reg||8
Z||000001||batboy||03-17-2000||10:03 PM||||I'm lucky because I've had some nice spring weather already, but crappy conditions have grounded my suspension project for the last three days straight now. Yuck! I want spring back too. Maybe 60's and sunny by Sunday!<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 03-17-2000).]||||reg||1
